{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45461","headline":"龙潭 · 应物","name":"龙潭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"石激悬流雪满湾，五龙潜处野云闲。\n暂收雷电九峰下，且饮溪潭一水间。\n浪引浮槎依北岸，波分晓日浸东山。\n回瞻四面如看画，须信游人不欲还。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45461.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45461","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}